    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Nestled in the scenic countryside of Greenan, this detached residence enjoys an elevated setting with \r\nbeautiful views overlooking Greenane and the surrounding Wicklow landscape.\r\n\r\nWhile the residence requires refurbishment, it offers an ideal canvas for buyers wishing to create a bespoke countryside home in one of County Wicklow’s most scenic settings. The property sites on 1acre, making it suitable for a wide variety of lifestyles including family living, remote working, hobby farming or those simply seeking a quieter pace of life.\r\n\r\nThe property stands on a mature site enjoying an elevated position with scenic countryside views overlooking Greenane. The grounds offer excellent outdoor space together with ample parking and potential for further landscaping or enhancement. \r\nPositioned within easy reach of Rathdrum and local amenities, this is an ideal opportunity for buyers seeking countryside living with space, privacy, and future potential"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "Accomdation includes\r\n\r\nEntrance Porch: 2.466m x 2.365m\r\nTiled porch area with access to the sitting room area. Window to the left of the property. \r\n\r\nSitting room : 4.209m x 4.100m\r\nRaised ceilings with open fireplace. Window to the front over looking the countryside. \r\n\r\nKitchen & Dining area: 3.572m x 4.131m\r\nStep down in the kitchen and dining area with door leading to the decking area. \r\n\r\nMain Bathroom: 2.588m x 2.139m\r\nLocated to the rear of the property, WHB, WC and bath\r\n\r\nBedroom Accommodation\r\n\r\nBedroom One: 3.152m x 2.943m\r\nBedroom Two: 2.915m x 3.008m\r\nBedroom Three: 2.004m 4.054m\r\n\r\n\r\nThe information contained in this brochure is provided in good faith and is believed to be accurate at the time of publication. While every reasonable effort has been made to ensure its accuracy, some details may have been supplied by the vendor and have not been independently verified.\r\nProspective purchasers are advised that no structural, boundary, measured or topographical survey has been carried out by the Auctioneers or on behalf of the Vendor in connection with this property.\r\nThe measurements, dimensions, areas and boundaries contained in these particulars are provided for guidance purposes only and should not be relied upon as being accurate. Prospective purchasers are strongly advised to satisfy themselves independently as to the condition, dimensions, boundaries, extent and suitability of the property prior to entering into any contract.\r\nThe Auctioneers and Vendor accept no responsibility for any inaccuracies, omissions or discrepancies arising from the information provided. All prospective purchasers should make their own enquiries and, where appropriate, obtain independent professional advice and carry out any surveys or inspections they consider necessary."
      },
